New look at biorhythms 
• All biorhythms for one selected person on one screen in the main app.    
• Selected biorhythm for all/selected people on one screen.   
• Portrait or landscape view for your comfortability. 
• Simple to use (intuitive user interface). 
• Fully customizable (including the ability to define your own biorhythms).
• Support for Apple Watch.
• Support for Dark Mode.
• Widget "Biorhythm Overall" in the Notifications Center.

Check biorhythms for you and your loved ones.  
Find out, what will look like your relationship with them now and in the near future.   

Biorhythms gives you: 
• Opportunity to learn yours and people around you physical and intellectual abilities at any given time.   
• Additional information about people close to you, you will learn to better understand them.   
• Determine compatibility between you and well known celebrities.

Apple Watch main features:
• quick check today's biorhythms for the person selected from the list of favourites
• use Force Touch menu for change person
• the most important information displayed by means of complications

Widget "Biorhythm Overall" in the Notifications Center main features:
• quickly check today's overall biorhythm for the same people as in the portrait view of the Biorhythm 4U app,
• open the Biorhythm 4U app directly from the Notification Center by tap the selected person

App Biorhythm 4U main features:
• portrait and landscape view;   
• two modes biorhythms presentation;   
• current trends and ratings;   
• partnership compatibility with trends and ratings;   
• compatibility list for persons;
• simple usage;  
• info panels describing the basic gestures;   
• copy information about people (name, surname and date of birth) from the phone's contacts;   
• synchronization and backup of the persons list through the iCloud;
• 3D Touch quick actions for iPhone 6s/6s+ and other supported device;
• persons list with peek & pop gesture and preview action menu for iPhone 6s/6s+ and other supported device;
• fully customizable (biorhythms, colors, ranges, sorting, filters, etc);   
• export to iMessage, e-mail, Facebook, Twiter and other.

The "Friendship bracelet" application allows you to create friendship bracelets weaving patterns.

Three types of weaving are available - straight weaving, oblique weaving, and simplified oblique weaving.

The "Friendship bracelet" application allows you to:
- add threads to the right, to the left and downwards;
- set color for each thread;
- edit friendship bracelet weaving pattern;
- flip the weaving horizontally and vertically;
- save weaving patterns to the gallery and load them;
- export weaving patterns as pictures.

Zikirmatik uygulamaları arasında en gelişmiş ve en kapsamlı uygulama olan Esma Saati’ni konsantrasyonunuz bozulmadan (reklamsız) kullanabilirsiniz.

- Bulunduğunuz konuma göre Yıldız saatlerini otomatik hesaplaması;
- İstediğiniz tarihe göre Yıldız saatlerinin vakitlerini önceden öğrenmek;
- Yıldız saatleri girdiğinde isteğe bağlı bildirim;
- Allâhü Teâlâ’nın güzel 99 ismi ve onların vasıfları;
- Resûlullâh (sav)’in yapmış olduğu günlük diğer zikirler ile - dinimizde en büyük ibadet olarak nitelendirilen ve evliyâlığa kadar giden bu yolda hayatını zikre adamış din kardeşlerimizin hizmetine sunuyoruz!

“Allâh isminin zikrini herkese nasîb eder mi? Senin ‘Allâh’ diyebilmen, Allâh’ın sana duyduğu sevginin işâretidir” - Hazreti Mevlânâ Celâleddîn Rûmî’nin bu muhteşem sözleriyle başlayan, Allâhü Teâlâ’nın güzel isimlerini içeren Esmâü’l-Hüsnâ’dan, Osmanlı ilim adamı, mutasavvıf yazar İbni İbni Îsâ İlyâs Sarûhânî Hazretlerinin “Esmâ-i Hüsnâ Şerhi” eserinde bahsettiği gibi, günlük yıldız saatlerine ve ebced sayısına göre çekilmesi tavsiye edilen Esmâ’ları faziletleriyle gösteren zikirmatik uygulamasıdır. 

Aynı zamanda değerli islam alimi, tasavvuf ehli, İbrâhîm Hakkı Erzurûmî Hazretlerinin “Ma’rifetnâme” eserinden ve modern astrolojiye göre içinde bulunduğumuz bu ilâhî sistemin gezegen saatlerinin insan üzerine yaptığı tesirleri, o saatlerde yapılması veya yapılmaması tavsiye edilen işler, davranışlar hakkında malumatları da kapsamaktadır. İlâveten, Cihân Serveri Peygamber Efendimiz Resûlullâh Muhammed (sav)’in yapmış olduğu günlük çekilecek zikirler mevcuttur.

Cenâb-ı Hak’la iletişim kurmak, her an, her saniye insan için vazgeçilmez bir ihtiyaç olduğu kadar, aynı zamanda gönüllere huzur ve ferahlık veren bir haz kaynağıdır. Nitekim Resûl-i Ekrem (asm) buyurmuşlardır ki: “Rabbîni zikredenle etmeyenin hâli diri ile ölünün hâli gibidir.” (Buharî, Daavât, 66)

“…Allâh’ı anmak elbette ibâdetlerin en büyüğüdür…” (Ankebût sûresi, 29/45.âyet).

Stylish and lightweight app to remember and track your events in a simple and fast! 

View the remaining days or days elapsed after an event. You can use it to remind you: appointments, anniversaries, birthdays, holidays, exams, events festivals ... customize with your own photos or use the search feature that finds thousands of free images on Pixabay! You can also create an alarm for each individual event. You can choose a favorite event to be displayed every time you open the app! 

VIDEO: http://youtu.be/5hGuOXYthJs

Features: 
- Works on iPhone, iPad and iPod touch; 
- Choose the event image, from: camera, gallery or search online on Pixabay; 
- Creates a notification for each event; 
- You can choose a favorite event for display at startup; 
- Days remaining before an event; 
- Days elapsed after an event; 
- Double click on the countdown to change the color; 
- Drag the countdown wherever you want; 
- List of all events; 
- Unlimited number of events! 
- Share an event on social networks (Facebook, Twitter ...) or with your favorite applications, save, print, copy, use as background Wallpaper! 

For information or suggestions, please use the support form in the About menu of the application.
